locked_body:
Your MorphoCloud storage (MyDrive) expired on {{kept_until}} and is now locked: your files are kept, but they cannot be opened, and you cannot use an instance.

MyDrive will be deleted on {{delete_on}}, with every file in it, unless a MorphoCloud admin approves more time. To ask, sign in to the portal and press "Ask to keep my storage": {{portal_url}}

If you have questions, contact {{contact_email}}.

deleted_body:
Your MorphoCloud storage (MyDrive) was deleted on {{today}}. It expired on {{kept_until}} and was locked for {{grace_days}} days.

You can create new, empty storage from the portal at any time: {{portal_url}}

If you have questions, contact {{contact_email}}.

approved_body:
A MorphoCloud admin approved your request. Your storage (MyDrive) now expires on {{kept_until}}.{{note_line}}

{{portal_url}}

If you have questions, contact {{contact_email}}.

declined_body:
A MorphoCloud admin declined your request to extend your storage (MyDrive). It still expires on {{kept_until}}.{{note_line}}

You can ask again from the portal: {{portal_url}}

If you have questions, contact {{contact_email}}.

admin_reminder_body:
{{login}} asked to extend their storage on {{asked}}, and no admin has decided yet. While the request waits, their storage is not locked.

Why: {{reason}}

Approve or decline: {{link}}
